---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import { ArrowUpRight } from "@lucide/astro";
import findYourTeamImage from "../assets/recruitment/find-your-team.jpg";
import { recruitmentTeams, siteConfig } from "../data/site";

const teamImageWidths = [320, 480, 640, 960];
const teamImageSizes =
  "(max-width: 520px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 800px) calc((100vw - 32px) / 2), (max-width: 980px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 320px";
---

<section id="join" class="section join-section" aria-labelledby="join-heading">
  <div class="shell join-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Join the crew · 一起籌備</p>
      <h2 id="join-heading">你不必準備好，<br />才有資格加入。</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="join-copy">
      <p>SITCON 由學生自發籌辦。這裡需要的不只是技術，也需要能溝通、能整理、願意觀察，或只是很想把一件事做好的你。</p>
      <p>先留下聯絡方式，正式招募開放時，我們會把消息送到你手上。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shell team-grid" aria-label="預計招募組別">
    {recruitmentTeams.map((team) => (
      <article class="team-card">
        <a
          class="team-card-main"
          href={siteConfig.preJumpForm.url}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          aria-label={`${team.name}：前往 SITCON 2027 預約跳坑表單`}
        >
          <div class="team-card-media">
            <Picture
              src={team.image}
              alt={team.imageAlt}
              formats={["avif", "webp"]}
              widths={teamImageWidths}
              sizes={teamImageSizes}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-detail">
            <h3>{team.name}</h3>
            <p>{team.details}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    ))}
    <article class="team-card team-card-more">
      <a
        class="team-card-main"
        href={siteConfig.preJumpForm.url}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        aria-label="還不確定組別：前往 SITCON 2027 預約跳坑表單"
      >
        <div class="team-card-media">
          <Picture
            src={findYourTeamImage}
            alt="SITCON Camp 工作人員在戶外集合拍團體照"
            formats={["avif", "webp"]}
            widths={teamImageWidths}
            sizes={teamImageSizes}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="team-card-detail">
          <h3>還不確定？</h3>
          <p>填表時填「還不確定，想了解更多」，我們會協助你找到適合的位置。</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="shell join-action">
    <div class="join-action-label">
      <span>PRE-JOIN FORM</span>
      <small>SITCON 2027</small>
    </div>
    <a class="giant-link" href={siteConfig.preJumpForm.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      提前跳坑
      <ArrowUpRight size={48} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true" />
    </a>
    <p>先留下聯絡方式，工作人員招募資訊公開時就能搶先收到通知。</p>
  </div>
</section>
